{
  "description": "The user's IBM connection as GET and PUT /v1/account/ibm-connection show it.\n\n`status` is active, or invalid once IBM refused the token or instance while a\njob ran. `token_last4` is the only part of the token ever shown, and the\nCRN is never returned. `backends` are the devices the instance could use when\nit was last checked (`validated_at`).",
